     Translate, the brand ZETIC, the domain zetic.ai, the model name Hy-MT2, the
     speaker labels A and B, the three app-language names and the 38 Hy-MT2
     reading-language names are constants in code, so nothing can translate them
     by accident. No value in any language contains an em dash or an en dash. -->
